Z||000014||Cheever2||10-18-2000||01:35 AM||||Well, Black88GT, there's Corvair engines.  Lots of buggy people use them, and they're American.  But if you gotta have a "water pumper", you'll just have to use your search.  Internet wasn't here when I was into buggies, but I saw lots of engines in them.  There's a pic of a V8 in one somewhere in sandrails.com.  And there are water cooled VW engines, just so you know.  Thumb through a HOT VW's magazine at the store.  That was my bible.<P><BR>||||reg||1
